---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "GTA 6 Waypoints: Map, Collectibles, Trophies & 100%"
description: "The GTA 6 completion companion: live launch countdown, every confirmed fact with sources, and the map, collectibles and trophy guides from Nov 19."
updated: 2026-10-23
headlineFacts:
  - k: "Release date"
    v: "Thursday, November 19, 2026"
    status: confirmed
    href: "/everything-confirmed/#release-date-and-platforms"
  - k: "Platforms"
    v: "PS5 and Xbox Series X|S"
    status: confirmed
    href: "/everything-confirmed/#release-date-and-platforms"
  - k: "Price"
    v: "$79.99 Standard, $99.99 Ultimate"
    status: confirmed
    href: "/everything-confirmed/#price-and-editions"
  - k: "Pre-load"
    v: "Local midnight, November 12, 2026"
    status: confirmed
    href: "/everything-confirmed/#pre-orders-pre-load-and-bonuses"
  - k: "You play as"
    v: "Jason Duval and Lucia Caminos"
    status: confirmed
    href: "/everything-confirmed/#story-and-characters"
launchDay:
  - text: "Interactive map"
    url: "/map/"
    note: "Every pin verified in our own play"
  - text: "Collectibles"
    url: "/collectibles/"
    note: "Every category, with counts and locations"
  - text: "Trophies & Achievements"
    url: "/trophies/"
    note: "Unlock conditions, missables, Platinum roadmap"
  - text: "100% checklist"
    url: "/100-percent/"
    note: "The master list, in the order to do it"
  - text: "Vehicles"
    url: "/vehicles/"
    note: "Where to find them and what they cost"
  - text: "Money"
    url: "/money/"
    note: "Early, mid and late-game methods, timed"
  - text: "Heists"
    url: "/heists/"
    note: "Setups, approaches and payouts"
  - text: "Guides"
    url: "/guides/"
    note: "Every how-to and best-of"
---
<div class="wrap">
  {% set cdSize = "hero" %}
  {% include "partials/countdown.njk" %}

  <section class="home-intro">
    <h1>The GTA 6 completion companion: map, collectibles, trophies and 100% checklists.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Fast, verified, no leaks. Every claim about Grand Theft Auto VI on this site carries a status badge and a source.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="facts-h">
    <h2 id="facts-h">Five things Rockstar has confirmed</h2>
    <ul class="facts">
      {%- for f in headlineFacts %}
      <li><span class="facts__k">{{ f.k }}</span> <a class="facts__v" href="{{ f.href }}">{{ f.v }}</a> {% badge f.status %}</li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p><a class="more" href="/everything-confirmed/">Everything confirmed about GTA 6, with sources</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="launch-h">
    <h2 id="launch-h">What opens on launch day</h2>
    <p>These pages fill with data we've verified in-game, starting November 19. Each one is live now so you can sign up for it.</p>
    <ul class="facts">
      {%- for l in launchDay %}
      <li><a class="facts__v" href="{{ l.url }}">{{ l.text }}</a> <span class="facts__k">{{ l.note }}</span></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>

  {%- set latest = collections.news | limit(5) %}
  {%- if latest.length %}
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="news-h">
    <h2 id="news-h">Latest news</h2>
    <ul class="news-list">
      {%- for n in latest %}
      <li><time datetime="{{ n.date | isoDate }}">{{ n.date | readableDate }}</time> <a href="{{ n.url }}">{{ n.data.title }}</a> {% if n.data.status %}{% badge n.data.status %}{% endif %}</li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p><a class="more" href="/news/">All GTA 6 news</a></p>
  </section>
  {%- endif %}

  {% include "partials/email-signup.njk" %}
</div>
